# CatDex Design System

**Source of truth:** `src/theme/` via `useTheme()` from `@/theme`. Never hardcode hex/rgba or ad-hoc spacing.

```ts
import { useTheme } from '@/theme';
const { colors, spacing, radius, typography, shadow, gradients, motion, opacity, iconSize } = useTheme();
```

## Colors (luminous · indigo brand · turquoise accent)

| Token | Value | Role |
|---|---|---|
| `brand` / `textBrand` | `#2D3B8F` | Headings, active nav, secondary chrome |
| `brandPressed` | `#243074` | Pressed indigo |
| `brandSoft` | `rgba(45,59,143,0.10)` | Soft brand tint |
| `accent` / `primary` | `#43D2C8` | Primary buttons, FAB, progress |
| `accentPressed` | `#36B8AF` | Pressed turquoise |
| `accentSoft` | `rgba(67,210,200,0.16)` | Soft turquoise tint |
| `rare` | `#8B5CF6` | Rare collection chrome |
| `legendary` | `#F59E0B` | Legendary collection chrome |
| `background` | `#F8FAFC` | App canvas |
| `surface` | `#FFFFFF` | Cards, sheets |
| `surfaceSecondary` | `#F8FAFC` | Nested / muted |
| `text` | `#1A1E3A` | Primary ink |
| `textSecondary` / `textMuted` | `#69758F` | Supporting text |
| `border` | `#E7EAF3` | Borders |
| `success` | `#34C759` | Success |
| `danger` | `#FF5C5C` | Danger |
| `onAccent` / `onBrand` | `#FFFFFF` | On filled CTAs |

Coat accents: `src/lib/catTheme.ts` only. Rarity: `rarityTokens` / `rarityFromCat`.

## Typography

SF Pro (iOS System); Android/web Syne + Manrope.

| Variant | Size |
|---|---|
| `display` / `h1` | 44 |
| `h2` | 34 |
| `h3` | 28 |
| `title` | 22 |
| `body` | 17 |
| `bodySmall` / `caption` | 14 |
| `tiny` / `label` | 12 |

## Spacing — 8pt grid

`4 · 8 · 16 · 24 · 32 · 40 · 48 · 56 · 64 · 80 · 96`

## Radius

`button=24 · card=28 · sheet=36 · md/input=20 · pill/full`

## Elevation

`shadow.none | low | medium | floating | glow` — soft brand-tinted, never harsh. FAB uses `glow`.

## Motion

`fast≈200 · standard≈260 · slow≈350 · reveal≈520`. Press `0.97` / card `0.985`.

## Components

Prefer: `Text`, `Button`, `Card`/`PhotoCard`/`CatDexCard`, `Chip`, `Badge`, `BottomSheet`, `EmptyState`, `Spinner`/`Skeleton`, `FloatingActionButton`.

Brand: **CatDex** — “Ton quartier. Tes chats.” Fun before utility.
